{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-4-10","kind":"proposition","title":"黄金三角形的尺规构造","englishTitle":"To construct an isosceles triangle having each of the angles at the base double of the remaining one.","book":4,"number":10,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.10","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.10/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":10,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷四"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-4-10@raw-5bb5be79f180d76f","contentId":"euclid-4-10","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5bb5be79f180d76f9c5bbd378b88b1e83041540dc0c35f22a0079fc268ced0d0","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-4-10.statement","euclid-4-10.construction.1","euclid-4-10.construction.2","euclid-4-10.proof.1","euclid-4-10.proof.2","euclid-4-10.proof.3","euclid-4-10.proof.4","euclid-4-10.proof.5","euclid-4-10.proof.6","euclid-4-10.proof.7","euclid-4-10.proof.8","euclid-4-10.proof.9","euclid-4-10.proof.10","euclid-4-10.proof.11","euclid-4-10.conclusion","euclid-4-10.historical.1","euclid-4-10.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-4-10.statement","contentId":"euclid-4-10","revisionId":"euclid-4-10@raw-5bb5be79f180d76f","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2bea2e96416a8b2b8adc1ee08c362b05d37fdbda7953c92516ef2b432f1fc140","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"To construct an isosceles triangle having each of the angles at the base double of the remaining one."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"作一个等腰三角形，使它的每个底角都等于顶角的两倍。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"求作两边等三角形而底上两角各倍大于腰间角"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"作一个等腰三角形，使它的两个底角分别等于顶角的两倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-10.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-4-10","revisionId":"euclid-4-10@raw-5bb5be79f180d76f","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"31be13909a6c6bb7defe1247accba1bcb063092d81ad49b310a566da6174afe1","citations":["euclid-2-11","euclid-4-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let any straight line AB be set out, and let it be cut at the point C so that the rectangle contained by AB, BC is equal to the square on CA; [[II. 11](/principles/euclid-2-11)] with centre A and distance AB let the circle BDE be described, and let there be fitted in the circle BDE the straight line BD equal to the straight line AC which is not greater than the diameter of the circle BDE. [[IV. 1](/principles/euclid-4-1)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"任取直线 AB，在点 C 处分割，使由 AB、BC 所作矩形等于 CA 上的正方形。[[II. 11](/principles/euclid-2-11)] 以 A 为圆心、AB 为半径作圆 BDE；由于 AC 不大于圆 BDE 的直径，在此圆中作弦 BD，使 BD 等于 AC。[[IV. 1](/principles/euclid-4-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-10.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-4-10","revisionId":"euclid-4-10@raw-5bb5be79f180d76f","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"056ffeb748accf647b546a9b9fded48a88aea97e0a50f6e4f68020759e4c232d","citations":["euclid-4-5"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AD, DC be joined, and let the circle ACD be circumscribed about the triangle ACD. [[IV. 5](/principles/euclid-4-5)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让AD,DC连接, 让ACD圆限制在三角形ACD上。 [[IV. 5](/principles/euclid-4-5)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-10.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-4-10","revisionId":"euclid-4-10@raw-5bb5be79f180d76f","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"39d8191ff5a3af3129348d5c6fe0c82d1efe4b3e6048b75051870f26fd787689","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since the rectangle AB, BC is equal to the square on AC, and AC is equal to BD, therefore the rectangle AB, BC is equal to the square on BD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"之后,由于矩形 AB,BC等于AC的正方形,AC等于BD,因此矩形 AB,BC等于BD的正方形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-10.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-4-10","revisionId":"euclid-4-10@raw-5bb5be79f180d76f","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"938c33d65630413e7f1673dec6d6fe43e95b22d0f7c19b6adea2c5afbf477d8b","citations":["euclid-3-37"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since a point B has been taken outside the circle ACD, and from B the two straight lines BA, BD have fallen on the circle ACD, and one of them cuts it, while the other falls on it, and the rectangle AB, BC is equal to the square on BD, therefore BD touches the circle ACD. [[III. 37](/principles/euclid-3-37)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于B点被移到ACD圈之外,从B直线BA,BD线落在ACD圈上,其中一条线被切开,另一条线被切开,矩形,AB,BC线等于BD线的正方形,因此,BD线与ACD线接上。 [[III. 37](/principles/euclid-3-37)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-10.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-4-10","revisionId":"euclid-4-10@raw-5bb5be79f180d76f","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b53ff5fd2e979b94f62053c1123a8d08d32b4d561689558d96d37b396e27704d","citations":["euclid-3-32"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since, then, BD touches it, and DC is drawn across from the point of contact at D, therefore the angle BDC is equal to the angle DAC in the alternate segment of the circle. [[III. 32](/principles/euclid-3-32)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"之后,BD次接触,DC次从接触点的D处抽出,因此,BDC次角等于圆圈中转角DAC次角。 [[III. 32](/principles/euclid-3-32)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-10.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-4-10","revisionId":"euclid-4-10@raw-5bb5be79f180d76f","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f2f04b785bbb238779f27dad7882d3669189727cd868c9b1fb354dad06bb0496","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since, then, the angle BDC is equal to the angle DAC, let the angle CDA be added to each; therefore the whole angle BDA is equal to the two angles CDA, DAC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,BDC角等于DAC角,让每个角加上CDA角;因此,整个角度BDA等于两个角度CDA,DAC。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-10.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-4-10","revisionId":"euclid-4-10@raw-5bb5be79f180d76f","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"62d230906e1eea77519f24cb72890c0a4fd9875a62990620e47ac0f2b15319ba","citations":["euclid-1-32"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the exterior angle BCD is equal to the angles CDA, DAC; [[I. 32](/principles/euclid-1-32)] therefore the angle BDA is also equal to the angle BCD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但外角BCD等于角度CDA,DAC;因此,角度BDA也等于角度BCD。 [[I. 32](/principles/euclid-1-32)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-10.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-4-10","revisionId":"euclid-4-10@raw-5bb5be79f180d76f","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1b58ce66028a1a24240a6d9edd469339808904efbad9d971590456dfefd40900","citations":["euclid-1-5"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the angle BDA is equal to the angle CBD, since the side AD is also equal to AB; [[I. 5](/principles/euclid-1-5)] so that the angle DBA is also equal to the angle BCD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但BDA角等于CBD角,因为AD角也等于AB;因此,DBA角也等于BCD角。 [[I. 5](/principles/euclid-1-5)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-10.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-4-10","revisionId":"euclid-4-10@raw-5bb5be79f180d76f","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"808f89f02526482caeb5b36fde8ed6fbd9bef5598e4289f3356d27bdb29b2453","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the three angles BDA, DBA, BCD are equal to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,三个角度BDA,DBA,BCD是等同的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-10.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-4-10","revisionId":"euclid-4-10@raw-5bb5be79f180d76f","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ec53f989fc5fe17b484a1399100ef58fc2f00fa133fb47b7f087ab38d7c7417b","citations":["euclid-1-6"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the angle DBC is equal to the angle BCD, the side BD is also equal to the side DC. [[I. 6](/principles/euclid-1-6)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"还有由于角度DBC等于角度BCD,侧BD也等于角度DC。 [[I. 6](/principles/euclid-1-6)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-10.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-4-10","revisionId":"euclid-4-10@raw-5bb5be79f180d76f","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8f2a8660f296a1cc1ab93d940244b2f8cb8edb1846fe658ed7ec54495cad1cef","citations":["euclid-1-5"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But BD is by hypothesis equal to CA; therefore CA is also equal to CD, so that the angle CDA is also equal to the angle DAC; [[I. 5](/principles/euclid-1-5)] therefore the angles CDA, DAC are double of the angle DAC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但BD是假设等于CA;因此,CA也是CD,因此,CDA角度也等于DAC角度;因此,CDA,DAC角度是DAC角度的两倍。 [[I. 5](/principles/euclid-1-5)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-10.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-4-10","revisionId":"euclid-4-10@raw-5bb5be79f180d76f","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d99619e036d8c3dca504f7c74e4ac1596d3e896ad51b43fef556add0cd560d94","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the angle BCD is equal to the angles CDA, DAC; therefore the angle BCD is also double of the angle CAD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但BCD角度等于CDA,DAC角度,因此BCD角度也是CAD角度的两倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-10.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-4-10","revisionId":"euclid-4-10@raw-5bb5be79f180d76f","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"649019e32d3c6e35a90a1d8f5bfba119492cc2e3caa8dd3841296c1dba90d7f0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the angle BCD is equal to each of the angles BDA, DBA; therefore each of the angles BDA, DBA is also double of the angle DAB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但BCD角度等于BDA、DBA角度的每一个角度;因此,BDA、DBA角度的每一个角度也是DAB角度的两倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-10.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-4-10","revisionId":"euclid-4-10@raw-5bb5be79f180d76f","order":14,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f9a4e3f0f581354b08f315f76d88724de5c83e7b09e05c11c41f35e8cadf44ea","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the isosceles triangle ABD has been constructed having each of the angles at the base DB double of the remaining one. Q. E. F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等腰三角形 ABD工程的每个角度均是其余1个角度的底边 DB倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-10.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-4-10","revisionId":"euclid-4-10@raw-5bb5be79f180d76f","order":15,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"67e66c597fd97464a467d346a116621a4f8b4c4e59f88996bba3239fc48655c2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"求作两边等三角形而底上两角各倍大于腰间角法曰先任作甲乙线次分之于丙其分法须甲乙偕丙乙矩内直角形与甲丙上直角方形等〈二卷十一〉次以甲为心乙为界作乙丁圜次作乙丁合圜线与甲丙等〈本篇一〉末作甲丁线相联其甲乙甲丁等即甲乙丁为两边等角形而甲乙丁甲丁乙两角各倍大于甲角论曰试作丙丁线而甲丙丁角形外作甲丙丁切圜〈本篇五〉其甲乙偕丙乙矩内直角形与甲丙上直角方形等即亦与至规外之乙丁上直角方形等而乙丁线切甲丙丁圜于丁〈三卷卅七〉即乙丁切线偕丁丙割线所作乙丁丙角与负丁甲丙圜分之甲角交互相等〈三卷卅二〉此二率者毎加一丙丁甲角即甲丁乙全角与丙甲丁丙丁甲两角并等夫乙丙丁外角亦与丙甲丁丙丁甲相对之两内角等〈一卷卅二〉即乙丙丁角与甲丁乙全角等而与相等之甲乙丁亦等丙丁与乙丁两线亦等〈一卷六〉夫乙丁元与甲丙等即丙丁与甲丙亦等丙甲丁丙丁甲两角亦等而甲角既与乙丁丙角等即乙丁丙与丙丁甲两角亦等是甲丁乙倍大于丙丁甲必倍大于相等之甲角也而相等之甲乙丁亦倍大于甲也"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"作一个等腰三角形，使两个底角都等于顶角的两倍。先任取线段甲乙，并在丙处分割，使甲乙与丙乙所作矩形的面积等于甲丙上正方形的面积〈二卷十一〉。以甲为圆心、甲乙为半径作圆，再在圆上截取弦乙丁，使乙丁等于甲丙〈本篇一〉，最后连接甲丁。由于甲乙、甲丁都是同一圆的半径，所以三角形甲乙丁是等腰三角形。为了证明底角是顶角的两倍，连接丙丁，并作三角形甲丙丁的外接圆〈本篇五〉。根据前述矩形与正方形面积相等的关系，乙丁与外接圆在丁处相切〈三卷卅七〉；由切线与弦所成角的性质，角乙丁丙等于角丙甲丁〈三卷卅二〉。再利用三角形外角定理〈一卷卅二〉及等角所对边相等〈一卷六〉，可得角甲丁乙和角甲乙丁各自都是顶角乙甲丁的两倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-10.source","contentId":"euclid-4-10","revisionId":"euclid-4-10@raw-5bb5be79f180d76f","order":16,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":